    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hi6a5fk",
      "content": "A car covers 150 m in 10 seconds. Its speed is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "xa7s99x",
      "content": "A) 10 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "nmv6dnp",
      "content": "B) 12 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "b6km26g",
      "content": "C) 15 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "tc2wcg9",
      "content": "D) 20 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "en4h3ss",
      "content": "<br></br>Correct Answer: C (15 m/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pqxtcg1",
      "content": "Detailed Solution:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "y1buxmh",
      "content": "Step 1: Write formula of speed."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qiqi5rc",
      "content": "Speed = Distance / Time"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8avumh8",
      "content": "Step 2: Substitute values."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0q8p91m",
      "content": "Distance = 150 m"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "od0qa3c",
      "content": "Time = 10 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "u0l9ttk",
      "content": "Speed = 150 / 10"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fo0vo2j",
      "content": "Step 3: Divide."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "w7phga3",
      "content": "Speed = 15"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ec2e4wf",
      "content": "Unit check: metre/second (m/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "xucxlj2",
      "content": "Final Answer = 15 m/s"
    },
    {
      "id": "lbyyrmx",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Q2."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dj2cd1s",
      "content": "A body increases its velocity from 5 m/s to 25 m/s in 4 seconds. Acceleration is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "nwueldw",
      "content": "A) 4 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ni55be5",
      "content": "B) 5 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "4jvldok",
      "content": "C) 6 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "4aapuzr",
      "content": "D) 8 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "uxbicmc",
      "content": "<br></br>Correct Answer: B (5 m/s²)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4x94od3",
      "content": "Detailed Solution:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ujkpwns",
      "content": "Step 1: Use formula of acceleration."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xcm8lf8",
      "content": "a = (v - u) / t"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mlz6bvb",
      "content": "Step 2: Identify values."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dskboha",
      "content": "Initial velocity (u) = 5 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "76sggxh",
      "content": "Final velocity (v) = 25 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "pv5523h",
      "content": "Time (t) = 4 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "MCQs",
      "id": "j3xx5do"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ii6zeez",
      "content": "a = (25 - 5) / 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8sc6lww",
      "content": "a = 20 / 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ty28pse",
      "content": "Step 3: Divide."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "uo8ycl5",
      "content": "a = 5 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "v3szezp",
      "content": "Final Answer = 5 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "id": "276h59g",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Q3."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fph0pr4",
      "content": "A body starts from rest and accelerates at 2 m/s² for 6 seconds. Final velocity is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "gjj7bpa",
      "content": "A) 8 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "uv67zf8",
      "content": "B) 10 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cm598bw",
      "content": "C) 12 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "ztbfbue",
      "content": "D) 14 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "5m4a56a",
      "content": "<br></br>Correct Answer: C (12 m/s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uadp91p",
      "content": "Detailed Solution:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ybfu2x3",
      "content": "Step 1: Use equation v = u + at"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xgt6v8g",
      "content": "Since body starts from rest, u = 0"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nhv9dn2",
      "content": "Step 2: Substitute values."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "mioidmq",
      "content": "a = 2 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0vd8g9h",
      "content": "t = 6 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "koa8s77",
      "content": "v = 0 + (2 × 6)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cxc2r7c",
      "content": "v = 12 m/s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "orsn99p",
      "content": "Final Answer = 12 m/s"
    },
    {
      "id": "bfln70n",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Q4."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mcr00x7",
      "content": "A stone is dropped from a height of 45 m. Time taken to reach ground (g = 10 m/s²) is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "qsgp2m1",
      "content": "A) 2 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "2y232hb",
      "content": "B) 3 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "vftjpfs",
      "content": "C) 4 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "kvhyymq",
      "content": "D) 5 s"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "5w3kb2s",
      "content": "<br></br>Correct Answer: B (3 s)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oyfi2ks",
      "content": "Detailed Solution:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5yuz7gu",
      "content": "Step 1: Use formula s = ½ g t²"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bo8pfoo",
      "content": "Given: s = 45 m, g = 10 m/s²"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wrrf050",
      "content": "45 = ½ × 10 × t²"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "q3f9dvh",
      "content": "45 = 5t²"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7mjk6rn",
      "content": "Step 2: Divide both sides by 5."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "1ofi1b7",
      "content": "t² = 45 / 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cjyzje4",
      "content": "t² = 9"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tthy9o6",
      "content": "Step 3: Take square root."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "plvxsmc",
      "content": "t = 3 seconds"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Multiple-choice questions test precise knowledge and elimination techniques in competitive exams.",
        "Always read every option thoroughly before selecting your final answer."
      ],
      "id": "lucmkzs"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "w4jkuvz",
      "content": "Final Answer = 3 s"
    },
    {
      "id": "fcxwwf5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Q5."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nwvueng",
      "content": "The area under velocity-time graph represents:"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "u6gvc38",
      "content": "A) Speed"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "0abp22q",
      "content": "B) Acceleration"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "zx2iwsb",
      "content": "C) Displacement"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "sd0ga8h",
      "content": "D) Force"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "thc25ww",
      "content": "<br></br>Correct Answer: C (Displacement)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dsw4m7y",
      "content": "Detailed Explanation:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f9e1u0e",
      "content": "In velocity-time graph:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6v1nrgz",
      "content": "Area under graph = Velocity × Time"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "tfanpox",
      "content": "Velocity × Time = Displacement"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0os5eiv",
      "content": "Thus, area under v-t graph gives total displacement."
    }
  ],
  "enriched": true
}